    {
      "id": "goal",
      "type": "goal",
      "text": {
        "uz": "b yoki c nolga teng bo'lgan kvadrat tenglamalarni diskriminantsiz, oddiy usullar bilan yechishni o'rganasiz."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "explanation-what",
      "type": "explanation",
      "title": {
        "uz": "To'liqsiz tenglama nima?"
      },
      "text": {
        "uz": "ax² + bx + c = 0 tenglamada b yoki c nolga teng bo'lsa, tenglama to'liqsiz kvadrat tenglama deyiladi. Uch xil holat bor: c = 0, b = 0 va b = c = 0. Ularning har birini oddiy usul bilan yechish mumkin."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "explanation-c-zero",
      "type": "explanation",
      "title": {
        "uz": "c = 0 bo'lgan holat"
      },
      "text": {
        "uz": "ax² + bx = 0 tenglamada x ni qavsdan chiqaramiz: x(ax + b) = 0. Ko'paytma nolga teng bo'lishi uchun ko'paytuvchilardan kamida bittasi nolga teng bo'lishi kerak: x = 0 yoki ax + b = 0. Demak, bunday tenglamaning bitta ildizi doim nolga teng."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "explanation-b-zero",
      "type": "explanation",
      "title": {
        "uz": "b = 0 bo'lgan holat"
      },
      "text": {
        "uz": "ax² + c = 0 tenglamada x² ni yolg'iz qoldiramiz: x² = −c/a. Agar o'ng tomon musbat bo'lsa, kvadrati shu songa teng ikkita son bor: +√(−c/a) va −√(−c/a). Agar o'ng tomon manfiy bo'lsa, ildiz yo'q: sonning kvadrati hech qachon manfiy bo'lmaydi."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rule-c-zero",
      "type": "rule",
      "title": {
        "uz": "c = 0 bo'lganda"
      },
      "text": {
        "uz": "Ildizlardan biri doim 0, ikkinchisi −b/a ga teng."
      },
      "formula": "ax^2 + bx = 0 \\;\\Rightarrow\\; x_1 = 0,\\quad x_2 = -\\frac{b}{a}"
    },
    {
      "id": "rule-b-zero",
      "type": "rule",
      "title": {
        "uz": "b = 0 bo'lganda"
      },
      "text": {
        "uz": "−c/a > 0 bo'lsa, ikkita qarama-qarshi ildiz bor; −c/a < 0 bo'lsa, haqiqiy ildiz yo'q."
      },
      "formula": "ax^2 + c = 0 \\;\\Rightarrow\\; x^2 = -\\frac{c}{a}"
    },
    {
      "id": "rule-both-zero",
      "type": "rule",
      "title": {
        "uz": "b = c = 0 bo'lganda"
      },
      "text": {
        "uz": "ax² = 0 tenglamaning yagona ildizi x = 0."
      },
      "formula": "ax^2 = 0 \\;\\Rightarrow\\; x = 0"
    },
